# Runtime state used to live here, beside the code. It now lives in the user's
# state directory (~/.config/gusnotebook — see src/gusnotebook/paths.py), which
# is the whole reason this is installable. These stay listed so a stray file from
# an older checkout can't be committed by accident.
settings.json
sessions.json
skills/

# The launch notebook: created in whatever directory you run `gusnotebook` in,
# which in this repo is this one. It's a scratch document, not source.
notebook.ipynb

.claude
CLAUDE.md
